  "title": "CapDepth: A Robust Framework for Monocular Depth Estimation in Non-Lambertian Surfaces",
  "summary": "CapDepth addresses the challenge of non-Lambertian surfaces (transparent or mirror) by leveraging detailed long captions and dynamic caption encoding to enhance robustness, while also incorporating random tone-mapping augmentation to improve lighting adaptability. It achieves 33.39% accuracy improvements in zero-shot testing and 5.21% performance gains on the Mirror3D dataset compared to previous methods.",
